# Cast during Bot1's own upkeep, The Eagles Are Coming! sets up its delayed trigger after that upkeep has begun, so "the
# beginning of the next upkeep" is Bot2's on turn four, not the one already under way (CR 603.7, 503.1): there is no Bird in
# Bot1's main phase, and there is one in Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
The Eagles Are Coming!
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Eagles Are Coming!.Cast
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl
? Step = Main1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Bird Soldier Token
Bot1.Hand = Ornithopter; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
